{"file": "重生螳螂，觉醒无限吞噬进化-第32集.mp4", "ep": 32, "duration": 94.4, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 1.6, "text": "能量积蓄已滿"}, {"start": 1.6, "end": 2.96, "text": "是否升級"}, {"start": 2.96, "end": 4.07, "text": "是"}, {"start": 4.07, "end": 21.79, "text": "想滾的時候"}, {"start": 21.79, "end": 23.03, "text": "就滾不了了"}, {"start": 24.44, "end": 48.58, "text": "不要動手"}, {"start": 48.58, "end": 49.93, "text": "我知道一個地方"}, {"start": 49.93, "end": 51.69, "text": "便利都是奇珍一寶"}, {"start": 51.69, "end": 52.93, "text": "隨便吃上一口"}, {"start": 52.93, "end": 54.25, "text": "就受益肥錢"}, {"start": 54.25, "end": 55.93, "text": "毫無興趣"}, {"start": 66.22, "end": 66.9, "text": "老大"}, {"start": 66.9, "end": 68.38, "text": "這一下午你去哪兒了"}, {"start": 68.38, "end": 69.46, "text": "找吃的"}, {"start": 69.46, "end": 70.9, "text": "八品金毛猴"}, {"start": 70.9, "end": 72.39, "text": "八品"}, {"start": 72.39, "end": 72.95, "text": "不是"}, {"start": 72.95, "end": 73.47, "text": "老大"}, {"start": 73.47, "end": 74.59, "text": "你八品了"}, {"start": 74.59, "end": 76.28, "text": "是啊"}, {"start": 76.28, "end": 77.32, "text": "你吃藥了"}, {"start": 77.32, "end": 79.28, "text": "這才幾天你又生了"}, {"start": 82.52, "end": 84.12, "text": "八品金毛猴什麼味"}, {"start": 84.12, "end": 85.95, "text": "讓我也嘗嘗唄"}, {"start": 85.95, "end": 87.51, "text": "這兩顆潘桃大捕"}, {"start": 87.51, "end": 89.33, "text": "給你"}, {"start": 89.33, "end": 90.45, "text": "味道不錯"}, {"start": 90.45, "end": 92.17, "text": "就是有點騷氣"}, {"start": 92.17, "end": 92.85, "text": "老大"}, {"start": 92.85, "end": 94.41, "text": "你這幹飯速度還是這麼快"}]}